@PrintDebateText Text:在泽渡可可的推定死亡时间……<br>也就是那场骚乱的约5分钟前。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我当时<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_11_01\">在会客厅里</link>。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"现场莲见蕾雅<br>和夏目安安<br>也都<link=\"Objection_02_02_11_02\">在</link>。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"可能因为她们<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_11_03\">聊得正入迷</link>……<br>所以才没<br>注意到我。|#0202Trial11_Nanoka004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

